    "cost_closing_html":  "About \u003cstrong\u003e$2.02 a bowl\u003c/strong\u003e for creamy turkey and shells. Compare that to $12 to $14 for any creamy pasta at a sit-down restaurant, or even $4 a serving for the boxed stuff once you add the meat yourself.",
